<title>USA: Hemispherx Biopharma Q1 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Hemispherx Biopharma Q1 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.14     loss	 $0.04</p>
<p> Net loss		   2,312     loss	   672</p>
<p> Revs			    30			 18</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  16,216		   15,582</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income for the first quarter of 1996 included a one-time gain of 4318,757 from the forgiveness of certain lease obligations.</p>
<p>Net loss for the first quarter of 1997 widened because of stock compensation and preferred stock conversion costs.</p>
